# name: test_help_messages[connection.set-default]
  '''
                                                                                  
   Usage: root connection set-default [OPTIONS] NAME [global options]             
                                                                                  
   Changes default connection to provided value.                                  
                                                                                  
  +- Arguments ------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | *    name      TEXT  Name of the connection, as defined in your config.toml  |
  |                      file                                                    |
  |                      [required]                                              |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Options --------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | --help  -h        Show this message and exit.                                |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Global options -------------------------------------------------------------+
  | Global options: --format, --verbose, --debug, --silent,                      |
  | --enhanced-exit-codes, --decimal-precision                                   |
  |                                                                              |
  | Run `snow --help` for full descriptions, or use `--help-all` on this         |
  | command.                                                                     |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Usage notes ----------------------------------------------------------------+
  | This command lets you change the default connection from the command line    |
  | instead of changing the value of default_connection_name in the config.toml  |
  | file each time. Using this command can simplify changing between multiple    |
  | connections.                                                                 |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Examples -------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | snow connection set-default "my_test_connection"                             |
  | Output: Default connection set to: my_test_connection                        |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Related topics -------------------------------------------------------------+
  | • https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/index          |
  | • Snowflake CLI command reference                                            |
