  |   command-reference/connection-commands/overview                             |
  | • https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/               |
  |   command-reference/connection-commands/add-connection                       |
  | • https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/               |
  |   command-reference/connection-commands/list-connections                     |
  | • https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/               |
  |   command-reference/connection-commands/test-connection                      |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  
  
  '''
