  '''
                                                                                  
   Usage: root custom-image [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                           
                                                                                  
   Manages custom images for Snowpark Container Services.                         
                                                                                  
  +- Options --------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | --help  -h        Show this message and exit.                                |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Commands -------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | validate   Validates a Docker image against Snowflake custom image           |
  |            requirements.                                                     |
