  |                 parameters following it will be passed over to dbt.          |
  | deps_compile    Execute deps_compile command on Snowflake. Command name and  |
  |                 all parameters following it will be passed over to dbt.      |
  | docs            Execute docs command on Snowflake. Command name and all      |
  |                 parameters following it will be passed over to dbt.          |
  | list            Execute list command on Snowflake. Command name and all      |
  |                 parameters following it will be passed over to dbt.          |
  | ls              Execute ls command on Snowflake. Command name and all        |
