  '''
                                                                                  
   Usage: root dcm describe [OPTIONS] [IDENTIFIER] [global options] [connection   
   options]                                                                       
                                                                                  
   Provides a description of a DCM Project.                                       
                                                                                  
  +- Arguments ------------------------------------------------------------------+
  |   identifier      [IDENTIFIER]  Identifier of DCM Project. Example:          |
