# name: test_help_messages[feature.query]
  '''
                                                                                  
   Usage: root feature query [OPTIONS] FEATURE_VIEW_NAME [global options]         
   [connection options]                                                           
                                                                                  
   Query online features for a feature view via the Online Service.               
                                                                                  
  +- Arguments ------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | *    feature_view_name      TEXT  Name of the feature view to query.         |
  |                                   [required]                                 |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Options --------------------------------------------------------------------+
  |    --from             PATH  Local directory containing the feature-store     |
  |                             project (must contain manifest.yml). Omit to use |
  |                             the current directory.                           |
  |    --target           TEXT  Target profile from manifest.yml to use. Uses    |
  |                             default_target when not specified.               |
  | *  --version          TEXT  Feature view version (e.g. 'V1').  Required      |
  |                             because the online lookup is keyed on (name,     |
  |                             version) — there is no 'latest' fallback for a   |
  |                             bare name.                                       |
  |                             [required]                                       |
  | *  --keys             TEXT  JSON array of entity key objects, e.g.           |
  |                             '[{"user_id": "u1"}]'.                           |
  |                             [required]                                       |
  |    --help     -h            Show this message and exit.                      |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Global and connection options ----------------------------------------------+
  | Connection options: --connection, --host, --port, --protocol, --account,     |
  | --user, --password, --authenticator, --workload-identity-provider,           |
  | --private-key-file, --token, --token-file-path, --database, --schema,        |
  | --role, --warehouse, --temporary-connection, --mfa-passcode, --enable-diag,  |
