  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Examples -------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | This example opens a notebook using a fully-qualified database and schema    |
  | name:                                                                        |
  | snow notebook open database.schema.my_notebook                               |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Related topics -------------------------------------------------------------+
  | • https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/index          |
  | • https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/               |
  |   command-reference/notebook-commands/overview                               |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  
  
  '''
