   Usage: root notebook [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                               
                                                                                  
   Manages notebooks in Snowflake.                                                
                                                                                  
  +- Options --------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | --help  -h        Show this message and exit.                                |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Commands -------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | create    Creates notebook from stage.                                       |
  | deploy    Uploads a notebook and required files to a stage and creates a     |
  |           Snowflake notebook.                                                |
