  | Run `snow --help` for full descriptions, or use `--help-all` on this         |
  | command.                                                                     |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Usage notes ----------------------------------------------------------------+
  | The snow spcs image repository deploy command creates an image repository    |
  | from its definition in a snowflake.yml project definition file. For more     |
