   Usage: root spcs service drop [OPTIONS] NAME [global options] [connection      
   options]                                                                       
                                                                                  
   Drops a service.                                                               
                                                                                  
  +- Arguments ------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | *    name      TEXT  Identifier of the service; for example: my_service      |
