  | --enhanced-exit-codes, --decimal-precision                                   |
  |                                                                              |
  | Run `snow --help` for full descriptions, or use `--help-all` on this         |
  | command.                                                                     |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Usage notes ----------------------------------------------------------------+
  | The current role must have OPERATE privilege on the service to set           |
  | properties.                                                                  |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Examples -------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | snow spcs service set echo_service --min-instances 2 --max-instances 4       |
