# ---
# name: test_help_messages[spcs.service]
  '''
                                                                                  
   Usage: root spcs service [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                           
                                                                                  
   Manages Snowpark Container Services services.                                  
                                                                                  
  +- Options --------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | --help  -h        Show this message and exit.                                |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Commands -------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | create                 Creates a new service in the current                  |
  |                        schema.                                               |
  | deploy                 Deploys a service defined in the                      |
  |                        project definition file.                              |
  | describe               Provides description of service.                      |
  | drop                   Drops a service.                                      |
  | events                 Retrieve platform events for a                        |
  |                        service.                                              |
  | execute-job            Creates and executes a job service in                 |
  |                        the current schema.                                   |
  | list                   Lists all available services.                         |
  | list-containers        Lists all service containers in a                     |
  |                        service.                                              |
  | list-endpoints         Lists the endpoints in a service.                     |
  | list-instances         Lists all service instances in a                      |
  |                        service.                                              |
  | list-roles             Lists all service roles in a service.                 |
  | logs                   Retrieves local logs from a service                   |
  |                        container.                                            |
  | metrics                Retrieve platform metrics for a                       |
  |                        service container.                                    |
  | remote-build           Builds an image or app artifact using                 |
  |                        the Snowflake remote build REST API.                  |
  | remote-build-history   Lists all remote build jobs for the                   |
  |                        current account from the past ~30                     |
  |                        days, newest first.                                   |
  | remote-build-status    Displays the current status of a                      |
  |                        remote build job.                                     |
  | resume                 Resumes the service from a SUSPENDED                  |
  |                        state.                                                |
  | set                    Sets one or more properties for the                   |
  |                        service.                                              |
  | status                 Retrieves the status of a service.      (deprecated)  |
  |                        This command is deprecated and will be                |
  |                        removed in a future release. Use                      |
  |                        describe instead to get service status                |
  |                        and use list-instances and                            |
  |                        list-containers to get more detailed                  |
  |                        information about service instances                   |
  |                        and containers.                                       |
  | suspend                Suspends the service, shutting down                   |
  |                        and deleting all its containers.                      |
  | unset                  Resets one or more properties for the                 |
  |                        service to their default value(s).                    |
  | upgrade                Updates an existing service with a new                |
  |                        specification file.                                   |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  
  
  '''
