  | Global options: --format, --verbose, --debug, --silent,                      |
  | --enhanced-exit-codes, --decimal-precision                                   |
  |                                                                              |
  | Run `snow --help` for full descriptions, or use `--help-all` on this         |
  | command.                                                                     |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Usage notes ----------------------------------------------------------------+
  | None.                                                                        |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  +- Examples -------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | The following example lists the contents of the jdoe.public.test stage:      |
  | snow stage list-files jdoe.public.test                                       |
  | Output:                                                                      |
