  '''
                                                                                  
   Usage: root streamlit list [OPTIONS] [global options] [connection options]     
                                                                                  
   Lists all available streamlits.                                                
                                                                                  
  +- Options --------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | --like        -l      TEXT            SQL LIKE pattern for filtering objects |
  |                                       by name. For example, list --like      |
